<x-screen-instructions :title="__('How to use Visit Removals')">
    <p>{{ __('A read-only log of every paid visit that was removed — who removed it, why, and how much it was. Nothing here can be edited or deleted. A visit with nothing paid is removed without a log entry.') }}</p>
    <p>{!! __('Visits are removed with <strong>Remove</strong> on a member\'s or an event\'s attendance tabs. While the visit\'s register shift is still open, a Manager can do it and the money is refunded from that drawer. Once the shift has closed, only an Owner can, and the closed shift\'s totals are left as they were.') !!}</p>
